{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_040_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_040_title", "source_sha256": "f7a069a889b0c6ecadd0133eb13fac06407cd2a339bba2d42a71c1a62e274667", "ja": "指先が示すところ", "zh": "指尖指向的地方", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_040_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_040_synopsis", "source_sha256": "82cfcecc4bd0fa8366b7276341ee5f7bec149eca61ac2df1b6be4c8fc66c4092", "ja": "センター公演のレッスンが順調に進む中、\n自分には何かが足りないと悩むエミリー。\nプロデューサーや仲間に背中を押され、\n自分が本当に目指したかったものに気づいた\nエミリーは、今できる最高の景色を目指す。", "zh": "Center公演的练习进行得很顺利，\n但艾蜜莉却觉得自己有所不足。\n而在制作人和伙伴们的鼓励下，\n艾蜜莉终于找到自己真正的目标，\n决定尽自己所能，追求最棒的景色。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_040_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_040_1000_032emi", "source_sha256": "2fceea66c7276f0a73124629912158d9a95ac8fa34179f61e2cec9e56debe73e", "ja": "みなさま、本日はありがとうございました！\n舞台は、お楽しみいただけましたでしょうか？", "zh": "非常感谢各位到场支持我们！\n不晓得各位看得是否尽兴呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_040_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_040_1001_audience", "source_sha256": "266b1131679f860fd86683c19f95d40dcbe87ab9af0c5d7881c483b332091892", "ja": "ワァアアア……！", "zh": "哗啊啊啊……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_040_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_040_1002_032emi", "source_sha256": "16fe80045d824e828e0693eae2def1ffb98dafb2e009c81bc218e3a48d56932f", "ja": "ありがとうございます！　今日の舞台に立てたこと、\n私、絶対に忘れません。この景色は、一生の宝物です♪", "zh": "谢谢各位！我绝对不会忘记今天站在这个舞台上的光景，\n我要把这片景色当成一辈子的宝物♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_040_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_040_1003_032emi", "source_sha256": "18e93d34520a729709c5e4b4895cac67fe25c2b7e047a2f479727fd68651269c", "ja": "これからも、どうか見ていてくださいね。\nまた、劇場でお会いしましょう！", "zh": "还请各位继续期待我今后的表现，\n我们下次也在剧场再会吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_040_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_040_1004_p", "source_sha256": "2db879bba0d0e841027c7c4fcb6e0808e4fa2f8d2ade16494e91630b0f0c7dd6", "ja": "（深々と頭を下げるエミリーに、拍手喝采が降り注ぐ。\n幕が閉じても、歓声はしばらく鳴り止まなかった）", "zh": "（观众为深深鞠躬的艾蜜莉献上喝采。\n就连闭幕之后，欢呼声依旧没有止息。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_040_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_040_1005_032emi", "source_sha256": "cc9453a9d0ddca5c29f26d3675af6e6cbd209e7ec80c6aa18f3a9ee2d78a29e4", "ja": "仕掛け人さま、やりました！　今の私にできる\nすべてを、ごヒイキ様方にお届けできました！", "zh": "策划执行人先生，我成功了！我将自己\n现在的一切，全都展现给各位主顾看了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_040_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_040_1006_032emi", "source_sha256": "6269658b4075b90a23da9eeae9cd7532b38e21fa16f605ab5ac1fdfec7daa582", "ja": "はっ！？　わ、私ったら、大きな声を出して、\nはしたない……。", "zh": "啊！？我、我真是的，叫得这么大声，\n真不得体……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_040_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_040_1007_p", "source_sha256": "3a3c2f7e07c6b1ea2e8e0b4354a5b371b25c3c7e6c9587ed03c14a7109150b6d", "ja": "それだけ、いいライブだったってことだよ。\nお疲れさま、エミリー！　よく頑張ったな。", "zh": "这就代表你的演唱会有多精采啊。\n辛苦你了，艾蜜莉！做得很好喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_040_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_040_1008_004yuk", "source_sha256": "4ccf862e6569cda69baf32b14fe24d0d8a8d3b4a139b731734fdc1307de635b1", "ja": "エミリーちゃん、すごくすごく素敵だったよ……！\nお客さんたち、ずっとステージに釘付けだった！", "zh": "艾蜜莉，你超级超级棒的……！\n观众们的目光都没有离开舞台过喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_040_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_040_1009_022ser", "source_sha256": "49c17c7301643eb2a2a4f64b67611987e6ca0bb43f1d824b9cc5c650a70fe27e", "ja": "エミリーちゃん、とってもキレイでした。\nあれが、大和撫子なんですね……♪", "zh": "小艾，你真的好美。\n原来那就是大和抚子啊……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_040_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_040_1010_032emi", "source_sha256": "1f927123bea2c4d1c4a380f359ad1cc4458c974af3a3f47dd1e10f944c9d3e4c", "ja": "あ、ありがとうございます。ですが、あのように\n舞うことができたのは、みなさんのおかげです。", "zh": "谢、谢谢各位的称赞。\n不过，我能像那样翩翩起舞，也都是托大家的福。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_040_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_040_1011_032emi", "source_sha256": "f62cb64492eecc14d0c12c561e0fb75c1f615c3ba038c9699ea722ef4f3051bb", "ja": "私のわがままに協力してくださって、\n本当にありがとうございました！", "zh": "大家为我的放纵任性提供许多帮助，\n我真的觉得非常感激！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_040_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_040_1012_p", "source_sha256": "238f7f42dfe1c0cfb647bc2edbe093f66122b8e3a4037c7786f00347cd3d2580", "ja": "エミリーのそれは、わがままじゃなくて\nこだわりだと思う。", "zh": "我觉得艾蜜莉那样不叫放纵任性，\n该叫坚持才对。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_040_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_040_1013_p", "source_sha256": "9740afbdfadc24b95b9ed428338636791d09dfaf2de538da5af5f24260ebfe2d", "ja": "自分なりのこだわりを持っているのはいい事だよ、\nエミリー。それがエミリーの、個性なんだから。", "zh": "有自己的坚持是好事，艾蜜莉。\n因为那会彰显出你的个人特色。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_040_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_040_1014_032emi", "source_sha256": "58a4bd548155120bca4a661b30ac169763a428c543a3f537d98e951aae0e8cb7", "ja": "個性……。", "zh": "个人特色……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_040_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_040_1015_026yur", "source_sha256": "81eae7e5e8aa9c75e137022f4f0cca42ead121acd6fc5c598c500d765a4fab0f", "ja": "わかります！　こだわり、大事だと思います！", "zh": "我懂！个人的坚持是很重要的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_040_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_040_1016_026yur", "source_sha256": "2cba6610b3cad4f44ebf3beba0cdbb576588c309cc89c36cca398b330a449046", "ja": "物語の主人公は、誰にも譲れない強い信念を\n持っているからこそ、輝くんです！", "zh": "故事里的主角也正是因为\n有着不能退让的坚定信念，才显得更加耀眼！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_040_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_040_1017_035hin", "source_sha256": "7f6989076d5b674680dcc2193eed7edf053b06205304e05efd488babeb17dbd8", "ja": "そうなんだねぇ。だからエミリーちゃんは、\nステージの上でも、キラキラに輝いてたんだべさ。", "zh": "原来如此，难怪艾蜜莉站上舞台，\n也能那样闪闪发光哪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_040_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_040_1018_p", "source_sha256": "f18b03c1522f3732ddead51371e9e9f0fd545bb1d3dd3441be9520c9a9adc7bd", "ja": "ああ。だからエミリーもみんなも、怖がらずに\n自分の個性を、お客さんに届けていってほしい。", "zh": "是啊，所以不管是艾蜜莉还是大家，\n我希望你们都别害怕，尽管对观众展现出自我个性吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_040_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_040_1019_p", "source_sha256": "30afb272869f20a6a51a9d9d55ac5525f7dbd66800f6850b1af877c5635292d6", "ja": "みんな、『たったひとりのアイドル』なんだからな。", "zh": "因为你们都是『独一无二的偶像』啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_040_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_040_1020_032emi", "source_sha256": "802f6ba1c6afef528483fc53f5c672253dcd175dc0ca45581de5cf039ddfd0f7", "ja": "仕掛け人さま……。", "zh": "策划执行人先生……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_040_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_040_1021_032emi", "source_sha256": "97985aef4c9a9c61f0b320ad4233cb5a045c83443a2840cb4997f768d62f42a3", "ja": "わかりました。私、自分のこだわりを大事に……\nこれからも、精進してまいりますね！", "zh": "我明白了，我会珍惜自己心中的坚持……\n今后也继续精进的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_040_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_040_1022_p", "source_sha256": "3e81602a4547e8eee3f321432d7f413b95f1c4a1080f5288d88fadf6f0d7f7a0", "ja": "ああ。それじゃ、そろそろ撤収作業が始まるし、\nみんな、着替えておいで。", "zh": "很好。那么，差不多要准备撤场了，\n大家快去换衣服吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_040_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_040_1023_026yur", "source_sha256": "8647b407ab1d9b2b78ce5c5e12cb5271181a5fe4550c907f09fadce71bc831a8", "ja": "ねえねえ、エミリーちゃん、みんなも。\nこの後、打ち上げしようよ！", "zh": "欸欸，艾蜜莉，还有大家，\n我们等会一起去庆功吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_040_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_040_1024_032emi", "source_sha256": "67389026d43d1bf29513173220509eb968c6c8ee2b7e74bb1b124de52a8746e2", "ja": "百合子さん、とても素敵な考えです！\n仕掛け人さまも、来てくださいますか？", "zh": "百合子，你这个想法真棒！\n策划执行人先生，您愿意一起来吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_040_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_040_1025_p", "source_sha256": "7914e8f5e975dfbba2f3d38bbdcbb3837ff97f9222cd36b8f5ee05e9bf667a45", "ja": "ああ。それじゃ、撤収作業が終わったら\nみんなに合流するから、先に行っててくれ。", "zh": "好啊，那撤场完毕以后，\n我会去找你们，你们先过去吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_040_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_040_1026_032emi", "source_sha256": "1b6a62814ca45010c0d2ea748b7364251ce2037d72915c408cbc78ffe18a095c", "ja": "はい、お待ちしてますね♪\nそれでは、お先に失礼いたします。", "zh": "好的，我们会等您♪\n那么，我们就先离开了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_040_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_040_1027_p", "source_sha256": "3f683ec8e9c3f3312cfb2e60b860ca2de18e3088568066f48fbd901f85017cda", "ja": "あ、それから雪歩……。", "zh": "啊，是说雪步……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_040_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_040_1028_004yuk", "source_sha256": "51560b833de4f2847539f4084e1ac6f1e2e91fe0b02c5c31a1735ea7676a673a", "ja": "はい？\n{$P$}、なんですか？", "zh": "是，{$P$}，\n怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_040_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_040_1029_p", "source_sha256": "abe77fff9660ef43bca8427b6fcec2f34ca5ca3b6b65ea28562824fed4237de1", "ja": "エミリーが悩んでた時、\n背中を押してくれてありがとう。助かったよ。", "zh": "艾蜜莉烦恼的时候，谢谢你在背后\n推了她一把，帮了我很大的忙喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_040_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_040_1030_004yuk", "source_sha256": "4804079f9c636cc68237673642540fe34d42971de36e692e6b58854b22d75d8a", "ja": "ええっ！？　そんな、お、お礼を言われるような、\n特別なことじゃ……。", "zh": "咦咦！？别这么说，我、我没有特别做什么\n值得被道谢的事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_040_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_040_1031_p", "source_sha256": "8182bd8390141c1112a27c60fa77c297ab3a8e9cf1f87f47f30e2a387a6ee061", "ja": "特別な事じゃないからよかったんだ。\n実体験だったからこそ、エミリーに届いたんだ。", "zh": "没有特别才好，正因为那是你的亲身体验，\n所以才能打动艾蜜莉的心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_040_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_040_1032_004yuk", "source_sha256": "dbd6495020ac8e0f2cbbe31d16fcb27c3bb2ed9e31f22fef68631b43bd27c252", "ja": "{$P$}……え、えへへ。\nそう言ってもらえると、うれしいです。", "zh": "{$P$}……嘿、嘿嘿。\n听到你这么说，我好开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
